D('harrow',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'After plowing, the farmer used a harrow to break up the clods.','犁地后，农夫用耙地机打碎土块。')],mistakes:[m('The tractor used a harrow to plant each seed at the correct depth.','The tractor used a seed drill to plant each seed at the correct depth.','A harrow breaks and levels soil; a seed drill places seed at a set depth.')],quiz:[q('harrow',1,1,'A farmer drags a harrow over a plowed field to?','break up and smooth the soil','cut wheat at harvest','pump water into the field','harrow 是耙地、碎土用的农具。'),q('harrow',2,2,'The tragedy harrowed the family for years. It?','caused them deep distress','made them laugh','helped them forget at once','The verb harrow can mean to cause severe distress.'),q('harrow',3,1,'Which object is a harrow?','a frame with teeth dragged across soil','a machine that milks cows','a container for grain','耙齿翻碎并平整土壤。'),q('harrow',4,2,'Which sentence uses harrow metaphorically?','The loss harrowed the family for years.','The gardener harrowed the field.','The machine harrowed the soil evenly.','Here harrow means to cause lasting distress.')]});
