D('harsh',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The teacher’s harsh remark embarrassed the student in front of the class.','老师严厉的话让学生在全班面前感到难堪。')],mistakes:[m('The blanket felt harsh and silky against the baby’s skin.','The blanket felt soft and silky against the baby’s skin.','silky 表示柔滑，与触感粗糙刺人的 harsh 相冲突，改为 soft。')],quiz:[q('harsh',1,1,'A harsh winter brings?','severe, difficult weather','a mild warm breeze','an early beach holiday','harsh 可形容严酷恶劣的天气。'),q('harsh',2,2,'A harsh tone from the supervisor sounds?','stern and unkind','gentle and soothing','musical and cheerful','形容语气时 harsh 常指严厉、不友善。'),q('harsh',3,3,'Harsh light in a photograph is?','too strong or glaring','completely absent','softly colored green','形容光线时 harsh 可指刺眼、强烈。'),q('harsh',4,4,'Harsh chemicals may?','damage skin or materials','make every surface softer','have no effect by definition','物质义强调苛刻、刺激或有损害性。')]});
D('harshly',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The editor criticized the draft harshly but explained how to improve it.','编辑严厉地批评了草稿，但说明了如何改进。')],mistakes:[m('She spoke harshly in a polite way to the visitor.','She spoke politely to the visitor.','The sentence describes one manner as both harsh and polite.')],quiz:[q('harshly',1,1,'The coach spoke harshly after the repeated safety violation. The coach spoke?','in a severe, critical way','with gentle affection','without making a sound','harshly 修饰说话方式，表示严厉地。'),q('harshly',1,1,'A machine judged harshly by reviewers was judged?','very critically','with no standards','only by its color','副词也能修饰评价，表示苛刻地。'),q('harshly',2,2,'The winter sun shone harshly through the bare window. The light was?','glaring and uncomfortable','soft and dim','completely blocked','harshly 可描述强烈刺眼的光。'),q('harshly',1,1,'Which sentence uses harshly naturally?','The judge criticized the decision harshly.','She harshly kindness the children.','The soup tasted harshly of sugar.','harshly 可修饰 criticize，表示严厉批评。')]});
D('harshness',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The harshness of the winter forced the village to close the mountain road.','冬季的严酷迫使村庄关闭了山路。')],mistakes:[m('The harshness of her gentle reassurance made the child feel safe.','The warmth of her gentle reassurance made the child feel safe.','温和安慰带来安全感，和 harshness 的严厉或刺耳相反。')],quiz:[q('harshness',1,1,'The harshness of the criticism refers to its?','severity or cruelty','accuracy of spelling','length on the page','harshness 是 harsh 的名词，指严厉或苛刻。'),q('harshness',1,1,'A listener complained about the harshness of the alarm. The alarm sounded?','rough and painfully sharp','quiet and soothing','perfectly silent','声音义表示刺耳、尖锐。'),q('harshness',1,1,'What does the harshness of the climate describe?','how severe and difficult it is','the number of local rivers','the color of the sky only','气候 harshness 指恶劣严酷程度。'),q('harshness',1,1,'Which noun completes the sentence? They softened the ___ of the penalty.','harshness','harshly','harmony','名词 harshness 可指处罚的严厉程度。')]});
D('hart',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'A carved hart appears on the village seal beside the oak tree.','村庄印章上橡树旁刻着一只雄鹿。')],mistakes:[m('The doe, a male hart, led the fawn through the woods.','The stag, a male hart, led the fawn through the woods.','hart 指成年雄鹿，雌鹿应为 doe；更换主语为 stag。')],quiz:[q('hart',1,1,'In an old poem, a hart is an adult male?','deer','rabbit','eagle','hart 是文学或古语中的雄鹿。'),q('hart',1,1,'A hunter in a medieval story follows a hart through?','the forest','the kitchen','the clouds','hart 指鹿，因此穿行森林的猎物语境自然。'),q('hart',1,1,'Which animal is closest in meaning to hart?','stag','doe','fawn','stag 是雄鹿；doe 是雌鹿，fawn 是幼鹿。'),q('hart',1,1,'The word hart is more common in?','traditional or literary writing','computer manuals','medical prescriptions','hart 是较古雅或文学性的动物称呼。')]});
D('harvest',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'Volunteers helped harvest apples from the community orchard.','志愿者帮助从社区果园采摘苹果。')],mistakes:[m('The harvest arrived before the seeds were planted in spring.','The harvest arrived after the crops had grown and ripened.','harvest 是成熟作物的收获，不能先于播种和生长。')],quiz:[q('harvest',1,1,'Farmers harvest wheat when it is ready. They?','gather the ripe crop','sow the seeds','water empty fields','动词 harvest 表示收割或采收成熟作物。'),q('harvest',2,2,'A poor harvest left the village short of grain. harvest means?','the crop gathered in a season','the field’s fence','a kind of tractor','名词 harvest 可指一次收获或收获量。'),q('harvest',3,3,'Scientists harvested cells from the sample. Here harvest means?','collected them for use','planted them in soil','painted them','引申义可表示收集所需材料或数据。'),q('harvest',4,4,'An animal harvest is?','the taking of animals for food or management','a crop of apples','a field being watered','harvest 也可指按管理或捕猎目的捕取动物。')]});
