D('hassle',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'Renewing the permit online saved us the hassle of waiting at the office.','在线续办许可证省去了我们在办公室排队的麻烦。')],mistakes:[m('The hassle-free booking process involved three lost forms and a two-hour queue.','The troublesome booking process involved three lost forms and a two-hour queue.','丢表和长队说明流程麻烦，和 hassle-free 冲突。')],quiz:[q('hassle',1,1,'What is the hassle of changing the booking?','the trouble and inconvenience it causes','the discount on the ticket','the color of the confirmation email','名词 hassle 指麻烦或不便。'),q('hassle',2,2,'The guards hassled the visitors for no reason. They?','bothered or harassed them','gave them clear directions','invited them inside','动词 hassle 可表示不断纠缠或找麻烦。'),q('hassle',1,1,'Which choice avoids the hassle of parking?','Taking the train','Driving around for an hour','Ignoring the traffic signs','避免 hassle 就是避开麻烦。'),q('hassle',2,1,'The reporter hassled the actor outside the hotel. The reporter?','kept bothering the actor','quietly thanked the actor once','never approached the actor','动词强调反复打扰。')]});
