D('haul',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'Two volunteers hauled the soaked canoe up the muddy bank.','两名志愿者把浸湿的独木舟拖上泥泞河岸。')],mistakes:[m('The crew hauled the crate up at the ramp.','The crew hauled the crate up the ramp.','haul 表示费力拖拉或运送；若没有拖拽动作，carry 更准确。')],quiz:[q('haul',1,1,'The crew hauled the net onto the deck. They?','pulled it up with effort','folded it into a shirt','threw it into the sea','haul 表示费力拖拉或拉上来。'),q('haul',2,2,'A long haul across the desert is?','a lengthy, difficult journey','a quick walk around a room','a short rest','名词 long haul 常指漫长艰难的过程。'),q('haul',3,3,'Police hauled the suspect in for questioning. Here hauled in means?','brought the person in','let the person escape','paid the person','haul in 可口语表示带某人到场。'),q('haul',4,4,'A truck hauling timber is?','transporting timber','planting trees','cutting paper','haul 可指用车辆运送重物。')]});
