D('hawker',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'A street hawker sold roasted chestnuts from a small cart.','街头小贩用小推车卖烤栗子。')],mistakes:[m('The report defines a hawker as someone who buys goods only for private use and never sells them.','The report defines a hawker as someone who sells goods, often in the street.','A hawker sells goods; a private buyer is not a hawker.')],quiz:[q('hawker',1,1,'A street hawker usually earns a living by?','selling goods in public places','repairing aircraft in a hangar','teaching a university course','hawker 常指街头小贩。'),q('hawker',1,1,'The hawker’s cry drew shoppers to the cart. The cry was used to?','attract customers to the goods','warn ships at sea','call birds to a tree','叫卖声用来招揽顾客。'),q('hawker',1,1,'Which person might be called a hawker?','a vendor selling fruit from a stall','a customer buying one apple','a farmer storing empty baskets','hawker 是销售者而非购买者。'),q('hawker',1,1,'In the market, a hawker offered hot noodles. The hawker?','was selling food','was collecting taxes','was planting crops','市场 hawker 在售卖商品。')]});
