D('hazardous',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The crew wears respirators when handling hazardous dust from the old insulation.','工作人员处理旧保温材料产生的有害粉尘时会戴呼吸器。')],mistakes:[m('The hazardous route has no cliffs, traffic, ice, or other danger.','The safe route has no cliffs, traffic, ice, or other danger.','没有危险的路线不该称 hazardous，应改为 safe。')],quiz:[q('hazardous',1,1,'Hazardous waste must be handled carefully because it is?','dangerous to people or the environment','made entirely of clean water','safe to touch without protection','hazardous 表示有危险的。'),q('hazardous',1,1,'Which task is hazardous?','entering a toxic chemical tank without protection','reading a map at a desk','watering a houseplant','无防护进入有毒容器有明显危险。'),q('hazardous',2,2,'A hazardous material warning tells workers to?','follow special safety procedures','ignore the label','mix it with food','警示危险材料须采取专门防护措施。'),q('hazardous',1,1,'The icy mountain pass became hazardous after dark. It became?','unsafe to travel through','easier to see','a place for indoor sports','结冰且天黑使山口通行危险。')]});
D('haze',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'A thin haze of smoke drifted across the valley after the distant wildfire.','远处野火过后，一层薄薄的烟霾飘过山谷。')],mistakes:[m('The haze made every distant ridge perfectly sharp and easy to see.','The haze made every distant ridge blurred and difficult to see.','haze 会使远景模糊，不会让山脊清晰可见。')],quiz:[q('haze',1,1,'A haze over the city reduces visibility because?','fine particles blur the air','the streets become shorter','the buildings turn transparent','haze 是空气中的薄雾、烟霾或尘霭。'),q('haze',2,2,'She was in a haze after staying awake all night. She felt?','confused and unable to think clearly','fully alert','extremely hungry only','比喻义 haze 可指头脑迷糊状态。'),q('haze',3,3,'A purple haze in the photograph describes?','a soft clouded effect','a sharp black border','a loud sound','haze 可用于描述模糊的色彩效果。'),q('haze',4,4,'The morning haze lifted as the sun rose. It?','gradually cleared','turned into snow indoors','became a solid wall','雾霭消散可说 haze lifted。')]});
