D('hazy',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The hills looked hazy through the bus window after the humid afternoon rain.','潮湿的午后降雨后，隔着公交车窗望去，山丘有些朦胧。')],mistakes:[m('The instructions were hazy, although every step was clear and unambiguous.','The instructions were clear, and every step was illustrated unambiguously.','Clear, unambiguous directions are not hazy.')],quiz:[q('hazy',1,1,'A hazy view of the mountains is?','unclear or blurred','perfectly sharp','completely dark','hazy 可描述看不清晰的景象。'),q('hazy',1,1,'If your memory of the address is hazy, you?','cannot recall it clearly','know every digit exactly','have written it down','比喻义表示记忆或想法模糊。'),q('hazy',1,1,'Which adjective means covered with a light mist?','hazy','hazardous','haughty','hazy 与薄雾、朦胧相关。'),q('hazy',1,1,'The plan remained hazy after the meeting. The plan was?','not clearly defined','fully settled in detail','cancelled by law','hazy 也可指计划不明确。')]});
